e.com/kr/app/lcd-clock-clock-calendar/id295737235?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "minimumOsVersion": "16.0", "genres": ["유틸리티", "엔터테인먼트"], "artistId": 295737238, "artistName": "forYou inc.", "releaseDate": "2008-12-05T04:27:43Z", "trackId": 295737235, "trackName": "LCD Clock - Clock & Calendar", "genreIds": ["6002", "6016"], "primaryGenreName": "Utilities", "primaryGenreId": 6002, "sellerName": "forYou inc.", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2026-06-26T21:14:19Z", "releaseNotes": "• Added new color themes. Support development to unlock even more themes to enjoy.\n• Made the weather location setting clearer, with easier on/off control for your current location.\n• Refined the purchase flow, share screen, and various other details.\n\nThank you for using LCD Clock!", "version": "26.3", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "LCD Clock — Simple Clock & Calendar\nLCD Clock combines a digital clock and a calendar into one beautifully retro LCD-style desk clock.\nJust place your iPhone on a charging dock, and your desk instantly gets a clean, easy-to-read clock and calendar.\nPerfect for your office desk, living room, or bedside table — adding convenience and clarity wherever you are.\n\nKey Features\n- Large, easy-to-read digital clock (12/24-hour format)\n- Monthly calendar (view up to 7 months)\n- Public holidays for countries worldwide, automatically fetched and highlighted\n- Weather forecast for your chosen location (current location supported)\n- Japanese era (Reiwa) and rokuyō display\n- Customizable first day of the week\n- 8 color themes plus a random theme\n- Adjustable screen brightness, shake-to-light backlight\n- Full-screen landscape clock mode\n\nA True Alarm Clock (iOS 26 and later)\nPowered by Apple's latest alarm technology (AlarmKit), the alarm has been dramatically upgraded.\n- Rings with a full-screen alarm even when the app is closed or your iPhone is locked\n- Breaks through Silent Mode and Focus — and keeps ringing until you stop it\n- Quick STOP / SNOOZE (5 min) buttons\n- Adjustable alarm volume in the app. Set it to mute for a silent, screen-only alert (with vibration while the app is open)\n\nNotes\n- Weather requires location access; holiday display requires calendar access\n- On iOS 25 and earlier, alarms are delivered as notifications (no sound in Silent Mode, and the notification sound stops automatically after a short time)\n- Please refrain from making complaints regarding malfunctioning alarms.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 5, "sellerUrl": "https://www.uuuu.to/", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN", "JA"], "fileSizeBytes": "48900096", "formattedPrice": "￦3,300", "trackContentRating": "4+", "bundleId": "foryou.LCDClock", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 2, "price": 3300.0, "userRatingCount": 2}]}